    \centering 
    \includegraphics[width=0.5\textwidth]{image/Setup.png} 
    \caption{The detector setup used for the $\beta$-decay measurement. The gold sample containing the $^{99}$Tc source is thermally coupled to the MMC sensor via gold wire bonds. A support washer with a Kapton tape on top for thermal insulation was placed below the sample to align its height with that of the MMC sensor.} 
    \label{fig:MMC-SQUID} 
