    This CW complex for a torus has one $0$-cell (the basepoint), two $1$-cells and one $2$-cell. We can attach each of these cells at appropriate times to find $|T|_0=3$ and  $|T|=a +b +c$, since we can take one $1$-cell with $w=a$, one $1$-cell with $w=b$ and a two cell with $w=c$. 

