\begin{lemma}
Let $f\in BMOA$ then $$f \in A^{\infty,\infty}_{\beta,\beta}$$ for all $\beta>0$.
If $$f \in A^{\infty,\infty}_{\beta,\beta-1-\alpha}$$ for all $\beta>\alpha+1$ and $\alpha>-1$ then $f\in BMOA$
with related estimates for quazinorms.
\end{lemma}
