    \caption{Time evolution of EE for other initial states. (Top row) Quench from a domain-wall state. (Bottom row) Quench from random product states (averaged). The parameters are \(L=200\). The qualitative features of EE growth and saturation are consistent across different initial states.}
    \label{fig:EE_evolution_domain-wall_and_random}
\end{figure}


