    \caption{Saturation EE for other initial states. (a) Domain-wall initial state. (b) Random initial states (averaged). The plots show \(S_{\mathrm{sat}}\) versus \(\lambda/|t|\). The smooth crossover in the GAA model (\(a>0\)) with plateaus corresponding to the spectrum gap is a robust feature.}
