 where $A_l^{-}=\al_2^{(l)}/(\sigma_1|\al_2^{(1)}|^2+\sigma_2|\al_2^{(2)}|^2)^{1/2}$, $l=1,2$, $\phi^-=\frac{1}{2}\ln\frac{(\sigma_1|\al_2^{(1)}|^2+\sigma_2|\al_2^{(2)}|^2)}{2i(k_2+k_2^*)^2(k_2-k_2^*)}$. Here, the subscript $l$ in $A_l^{-}$  denotes the SW components and superscript ($-$) represents before collision. \\
\underline{(b) After collision}: $t\rightarrow +\infty$\\
